== '''Overview''' ==

'''Helicopter Camo Toilet''' is a non-boss enemy toilet, that spawns in some waves in [[Nightmare Mode]] and [[Endless Mode]].

== '''Waves''' ==
Tba

== '''Trivia''' ==

* It is one of the few enemy toilets to fly using a helicopter rover instead of an jetpack. This makes sense since in the actual series, toilets can fly using helicopter rovers, as long as it is not destroyed.
* One of the only few enemy toilets to have an (roblox face name) in their heads.
* One of the only few enemy toilets to have more than one rocket launchers

